{
 "about": "The curated pool of opening (hero) photos for the cinematic opening preview (?opening=cinematic / preview key 'cinematic'). Every photo: a living snake in the wild or in natural surroundings, sharp eye or clearly visible head, no handling, no dead or feeding animals, species as in SnakeList, and a licence that allows a site with ads (data/photo-licences.json commercialOK, or CC0/CC BY/CC BY-SA with credit). Files: species-photos/hero/<id>-<width>.webp, all in the opening's 2560:1658 shape. focal = the snake's eye/head as fractions of the photo; crop.phone = the object-position used on upright phones (the photo is cropped there), crop.desktop = on wide screens (the whole photo shows); logo = [top, bottom, centre-x] of the band the logo may use (default [0.6, 0.9, 0.5]). The page carries a copy (SL_HERO_POOL) written by tools/hero_pool.py.",
